cobbler_0d457e57		The cobblers aren't bad. They're not as sweet as you had hoped they'd be, but that makes sense since peach season starts next month. You wish you had accounted for the difference and adjusted your recipe, but this is good practice for the real thing!	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	37	"[what]"
cobbler_79abfdd0		You divide the cobblers into plastic food storage bins, packing some into a small picnic basket and the rest into the fridge. Some of my older friends will probably love this.	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	39	"[what]"
