orchardist_ca983195		This orchard front house is cozy, very modern for a historic administrative building. Joy turned the downstairs into a social space with couches, bar counters, and plenty of plants so visitors and farmers alike have a place to relax out of the sun.	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	83	"[what]"
orchardist_d78fe09b		The modern space is in stark contrast to the must and dust of the upstairs, which largely resembles an attic. It's where the real business happens.	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	85	"[what]"
