shes_bold_a200fcd8	lyd	"But what if it WAS flirting? And you liked her. So you should give her a chance and see where it goes."	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	404	lyd "[what]"
shes_bold_b478b98c	a	"I don't want to assume that and get hurt, you know? It's been hard since mom and dad left. You know I haven't dated anyone since then. Plus, she's younger than me..."	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	406	a "[what]"
shes_bold_59e6b3c0	lyd	"I get where you're coming from, but you need to live a little. Have a little summer romance. It'll be fine, it'll be fun! And don't talk to me about age, you're both youngsters. You don't know how annoying age gap problems can be when you get to be 300 instead of 30."	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	408	lyd "[what]"
shes_bold_bcb3ed40	a	"Right, sorry. Well, I haven't seen her again since then. She could have bailed and gone back home."	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	411	a neutral "[what]"
shes_bold_5647d3ac	lyd	"You two made a pact, though. If she's so {i}bold{/i}, she'll show up."	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	413	lyd "[what]"
shes_bold_f9bffa9c	a	"That's fair. I guess I did see her at the cornerstore..."	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	416	a neutral "[what]"
shes_bold_d96a2199	lyd	"See? She's staying!"	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	418	lyd "[what]"
shes_bold_55632ede		Lydia primly sips her tea. You know she's probably right, but...	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	420	"[what]"
shes_bold_64a124f9		You'll have to see what happens.	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	422	"[what]"
shes_cute_1627314f	a	"Really cute. Clumsy and cute."	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	431	a blush "[what]"
shes_cute_a801f24a	lyd	"Oh my, does little Aya have a crush?"	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	433	lyd "[what]"
shes_cute_51f2e067	a	"I don't really have time for a crush..."	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	435	a tsuntsun "[what]"
shes_cute_0f414f28		Lydia snorts.	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	437	"[what]"
shes_cute_aec35cad	lyd	"All you have is time. You're just moldering away among those books. You're a cute girl, Aya, and you'd be extra cute with a cutie by your side."	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	439	lyd "[what]"
shes_cute_a53853d4	a	"Lyd!! I barely know her!"	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	441	a excited "[what]"
shes_cute_016548af	lyd	"Just saying!"	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	443	lyd "[what]"
shes_cute_75957a84		You grumble something rude into your teacup and she pretends to not hear, ears swiveled away.	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	445	"[what]"
lydia_change_subject_06a80ad4		You don't really want to talk about Erin...	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	452	"[what]"
lydia_change_subject_470ee315	a	"She's just some girl, I don't have much to say about her."	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	454	a tsuntsun "[what]"
lydia_change_subject_87d72ba1		Which is more or less true. Lydia gives you a dirty look. She's got this "knowing old woman" expression that looks out of place on her unlined face.	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	456	"[what]"
lydia_change_subject_044081cd	lyd	"Fine, keep your secrets."	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	458	lyd "[what]"
