cornerstore_6aa7cfc4		Little birds peck at scattered seeds and tiny crumbs on the sidewalk. The little fellows hop out of the way when you walk past.	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	489	"[what]"
cornerstore_969e165e		Outside the cornerstore you see a stack of familiar blue milk cartons.	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	492	"[what]"
