cornerstore_df0bcf9f		You walk the aisles, picking treats off shelves. Your neighbor Timothy gives you a nod as he walks past you with a canvas tote bag over his shoulder. You nod back.	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	501	"[what]"
cornerstore_e47d7f7b		Whenever you run into each other here he's always picking up an unbelievable quantity of whipped cream. You're sure that's what he got today, too.	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	503	"[what]"
cornerstore_40cca24f		He must really love the stuff.	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	505	"[what]"
cornerstore_57221ffd	e	"Aya? Is that you?"	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	507	e neutral "[what]"
cornerstore_d05a246e		She's here. Like a breath of fresh air.	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	511	"[what]"
cornerstore_84b17828	a	"Erin!"	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	513	a shocked "[what]"
cornerstore_88708beb		You take in her apron and the box of candies she's holding tucked under one arm.	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	515	"[what]"
cornerstore_b4df409a	a	"So this is where you've been! You're... working here? How'd you get a job so fast?"	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	517	a "[what]"
cornerstore_0c5cbb67	e	"Oh, I'm doing jobs here and there around town. But I'm renting a room from this store's owner."	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	521	e happy "[what]"
cornerstore_42e999fd	a	"Cindy, right? She's very sweet. I'm glad you found a place to stay, but why aren't you back home?"	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	523	a neutral "[what]"
cornerstore_c7522560	e	"I wasn't ready to go back yet. Besides... I still gotta help you find that spell, right?"	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	525	e excited "[what]"
cornerstore_3a1f723b		Right... but that's not for another month. You thought she'd just come back when it's time, but apparently not.	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	527	"[what]"
cornerstore_640981c4	a	"Ah, well... it's good to see you. I hope you've been well?"	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	529	a happy "[what]"
cornerstore_6fd6f7bb		She steps past you and starts to unpack the box, restocking the shelf.	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	531	"[what]"
cornerstore_b7aae153		She's close enough that the light scent of citrus and apples wafts from her hair. It's a very bright and happy scent... it suits her.	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	533	"[what]"
cornerstore_6a822ba8	e	"I have! So, you doing some shopping today? Or did you just come here to find me?"	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	535	e rizzler "[what]"
