cornerstore_f87a3bbd	e	"I'm glad our paths crossed, then! What are you doing later? I'm here 'til 7, but not busy tonight. We could hang out!"	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	541	e happy "[what]"
cornerstore_de416055		This seems like a hint. You're not doing anything, but you want to keep to yourself this weekend and recharge...	game/script files/3_cobblercornerstore.rpy	543	"[what]"
