farmers_market_cont_a432dbba	jeff	"Nonsense, we'll be just fine. She was a huge help unloading everything this morning, but we can take it from here. Kiddo, let me pay you now so you have some change for the rest of the market."	game/script files/3_farmersmarket.rpy	121	jeff "[what]"
