going_home_from_market_54a124cf		Your home is old and loved, the result of generations of care and curation. The walnut tables and shelves glisten with wood oil--you just polished everything last week.	game/script files/3_farmersmarket.rpy	309	"[what]"
going_home_from_market_d3997a23		Paintings and pictures of family members in various settings dot the walls. You smile when Erin notices a favorite of yours--a picture of your parents and their mates in their youth sprawled on a picnic blanket beneath a blossoming spring cherry tree.	game/script files/3_farmersmarket.rpy	311	"[what]"
going_home_from_market_727ff95c	a	"Please, make yourself at home."	game/script files/3_farmersmarket.rpy	313	a "[what]"
