orchard_b5033d55		Your first stop is the orchard. Three Peach Hill started very small, and like the name implies, it began with just three peach saplings on the big hill.	game/script files/4_orchard.rpy	19	"[what]"
orchard_88f789cd		The orchard expanded outward from that hill. Those first three peach trees are now massive. They should be well past their prime, but through magic they've stayed young and healthy and continue to produce beautiful fruit every season.	game/script files/4_orchard.rpy	21	"[what]"
orchard_edc84996		You've loved resting under their boughs since you were a kit. It's not a private place by any means, but it's {i}your{/i} spot. A visit seems like just the thing to center you right now.	game/script files/4_orchard.rpy	23	"[what]"
