lost_market_inside_1aa7aca1		Her body is warm against yours.	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	304	"[what]"
lost_market_inside_511a5e05		Her lips part invitingly.	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	306	"[what]"
lost_market_inside_b944b909		You could kiss her if you just...	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	308	"[what]"
lost_market_inside_2c998b67	e	"Uh, you don't have to keep carrying me."	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	310	e blush "[what]"
lost_market_inside_d48d07a9	a	"Ah, sorry."	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	312	a "[what]"
lost_market_inside_1480190f		You set her on her feet and straighten her clothes, looking her all over. There are no telltale ribbons of other pacts, but you have to be sure.	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	314	"[what]"
lost_market_inside_31f42505	a	"Are you alright? You didn't make any other bargains while there, right?"	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	316	a sad "[what]"
lost_market_inside_1db58695	e	"No, no. That was close, though. It felt like I had been there for hours, and had been hounded by all sorts of spirits wanting... different things."	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	318	e neutral "[what]"
lost_market_inside_7a9073fe	e	"That last one was kinder than the others, though, so it seemed like my best option for getting back home."	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	320	e "[what]"
lost_market_inside_d5db8356	a	"She may have seemed kinder, but that doesn't mean she didn't have ill-intent. If you had brought her over, she would have eaten you."	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	322	a "[what]"
lost_market_inside_56dca6e1		Erin blanches.	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	324	"[what]"
lost_market_inside_b1a1b015	e	"O-oh."	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	326	e "[what]"
lost_market_inside_821f28b3		You soften your expression.	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	328	"[what]"
lost_market_inside_50c9b96a	a	"How did you get there, anyway?"	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	330	a neutral "[what]"
lost_market_inside_9a22fbe9	e	"Well, I was following that little grey cat and it went down this alley. It disappeared, and I was curious about the lights, so... I kept walking. I had never seen that before."	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	332	e "[what]"
lost_market_inside_16b363f5	a	"Oh, Erin."	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	334	a "[what]"
lost_market_inside_7e4361fe		You pull her into your arms and hold her tightly. You feel so... protective of her.	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	336	"[what]"
lost_market_inside_6ef2e1e3	a	"I'm so glad I found you in time. That you didn't get hurt!"	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	338	a shocked "[what]"
lost_market_inside_8c2c27f4	e	"I didn't know how dangerous it was... So scary..."	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	340	e gloom "[what]"
lost_market_inside_b0707626		You smooth her hair and heave a sigh of relief.	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	342	"[what]"
lost_market_inside_2e270aca	a	"I know. It's okay. Just... don't go following weird lights like that without me, okay?"	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	344	a happy "[what]"
lost_market_inside_1be8c2a7	e	"I won't. But do you think that cat is okay?"	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	346	e sad "[what]"
lost_market_inside_e48d21ee	a	"I'm positive it is. Cats have a way of slinking across the boundary with more ease than practically any other creature. If it crossed over, it can simply stroll right back."	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	348	a "[what]"
lost_market_inside_6b01a23c	a	"And since it's just a cat, nothing is going to bother it."	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	350	a excited "[what]"
lost_market_inside_6472ea51	e	"Thank goodness!"	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	352	e excited "[what]"
lost_market_inside_e88b4e81		You stay embraced for a few long breaths as your heartbeats slow.	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	354	"[what]"
lost_market_inside_357ba4ef	a	"I'll walk you home."	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	356	a happy "[what]"
lost_market_inside_c3eca7d1	e	"Sure, I'd like that."	game/script files/8_lostmarket.rpy	358	e happy "[what]"
date_e08c1932		You check your hair in the mirror one more time and take a calming breath, then grab your keys and coat and head for the door.	game/script files/9_date.rpy	8	"[what]"
date_6b629a47		After what happened at the Lost Market, Erin took the last two days off to rest. She slept for about 20 hours the first day, which had you worried.	game/script files/9_date.rpy	10	"[what]"
