date_065a76ef		"See you in a bit!"	game/script files/9_date.rpy	15	"[what]"
date_68c5c008		You asked her to meet you at the nearby cafe so you could check on her, and because you've come to a decision.	game/script files/9_date.rpy	17	"[what]"
date_3fbd9e62		No more wishy-washiness.	game/script files/9_date.rpy	19	"[what]"
date_1d589737		You set your coffee cup down. The ceramic clinks against the saucer.	game/script files/9_date.rpy	26	"[what]"
date_5b92e513	a	"I've given it a lot of thought, and... I don't want to go to the Lost Market tomorrow."	game/script files/9_date.rpy	28	a neutral "[what]"
date_e7531fc1	e	"What? Then how will you get that spell?"	game/script files/9_date.rpy	30	e shocked "[what]"
date_b60db6c3	a	"I'm not happy about how close you came to getting eaten by a tricky spirit, and I don't think it's a good idea for us to go back so soon."	game/script files/9_date.rpy	32	a sad "[what]"
date_64267ff1	e	"It was one time, and I was by myself! You'll be there this time, right? So what happened last time isn't going to happen again."	game/script files/9_date.rpy	34	e "[what]"
date_964b462b	a	"It's too risky. Those spirits were really agitated."	game/script files/9_date.rpy	36	a neutral "[what]"
date_6a0524ae		You hesitantly reach across the table and rest a hand over hers.	game/script files/9_date.rpy	38	"[what]"
date_aee449bd	a	"I wanted to go to get back something precious to me, but..."	game/script files/9_date.rpy	40	a "[what]"
