date_1caa1ca0		Erin doesn't seem soothed by this.	game/script files/9_date.rpy	44	"[what]"
date_fa67b558	e	"Right, a human life is more important than a lamp, I get it. But I don't want to owe you something. I broke that lamp, I should take care of it."	game/script files/9_date.rpy	46	e neutral "[what]"
