confession_c4838e38		Your cheeks are DEFINITELY pink, but you gather all the rizz in your heart.	game/script files/9_date.rpy	77	"[what]"
confession_2a65599a	a	"Sounds like we should do something about it, then."	game/script files/9_date.rpy	79	a "[what]"
confession_654f183e	e	"Yeah??"	game/script files/9_date.rpy	81	e rizzler "[what]"
