confession_2a25b51e		With a wave of your left hand, you summon the contract you signed together. It's as simple as plucking the page from the air.	game/script files/9_date.rpy	87	"[what]"
confession_ec7ae507		You take the contract in one hand, still holding Erin's hand with the other, and when you speak your words ring clear as a bell.	game/script files/9_date.rpy	91	"[what]"
