confession_80e8ee90		With those simple words, the page crumbles into dust.	game/script files/9_date.rpy	98	"[what]"
confession_d179afb2		The contract between you breaks with a faint snap.	game/script files/9_date.rpy	100	"[what]"
confession_69417da6	a	"Now you don't owe me anything. The debt is forgiven, both figuratively and literally."	game/script files/9_date.rpy	102	a excited "[what]"
confession_98a65104	e	"That means a lot to me, and I'm SO happy you confessed, but... does this mean you're giving up on fixing the lamp? It's so important to you."	game/script files/9_date.rpy	104	e sad "[what]"
